VOICE
  Narration: Microsoft neural voice en-US-EmmaNeural, generated through Microsoft's online speech service
  with the edge-tts client (https://github.com/rany2/edge-tts). Check Microsoft's terms before any commercial use.

MUSIC AND SOUND EFFECTS
  Original. Every note and effect is synthesized in mix.py (numpy/scipy) with the procedural helpers of
  core/audio/sfx.py. No samples, loops or recordings by third parties.

PICTURE
  Original. Every frame is drawn in code (film.js, cast.js, kit.js). No images, footage or generated video.

TOOLS (used to make the film, not part of it)
  Speech check: faster-whisper with the Whisper small.en / base.en models (MIT).
  Rendering and mux: Chrome Headless Shell via playwright-core (Apache-2.0), ffmpeg.

